// ========== SIGNALS ==========
Signal Heat
Signal TouchInput
Signal DisplayData
Signal ControlCommand
Signal HeatingControlSignal
Signal NotificationData
Signal WiFiData
Signal ElectricalPower
Signal TimerSignal

// ========== EXTERNAL ENTITIES ==========

Component User
Port Hand Output TouchInput
Port Eye Input DisplayData

Component Smartphone
Port WiFi Input WiFiData

Component PowerGrid
Port Outlet Output ElectricalPower

// ========== MATERIAL COMPONENTS ==========

Component Toast
Port Surface Input Heat

Component Breadroll  
Port Surface Input Heat

Component Crumbs
Port Collection  // Mechanical, no heat

// ========== TOASTER SUBSYSTEMS ==========

Component TouchDisplay
Port TouchSurface Input TouchInput
Port Controller Output ControlCommand
Port Visual Output DisplayData

Component Microcontroller
Port DisplayInterface Input ControlCommand
Port SlotHeaterControl Output HeatingControlSignal  // Separate!
Port GridHeaterControl Output HeatingControlSignal  // Separate!
Port WiFiControl Output NotificationData
Port TimerInterface Input TimerSignal
Port PowerIn Input ElectricalPower

Component HeatingElement
Port ControlSignal Input HeatingControlSignal
Port PowerIn Input ElectricalPower
Port HeatOutput Output Heat

Component Timer
Port PowerIn Input ElectricalPower
Port TimeSignal Output TimerSignal

Component WiFiModule
Port Controller Input NotificationData
Port Antenna Output WiFiData
Port PowerIn Input ElectricalPower

Component ToastChamber
Port HeatInterface Input Heat  
Port SlotOutput Output Heat    

Component BreadRollAttachment
Port HeatInterface Input Heat
Port GridOutput Output Heat    

Component CrumbTray
Port CrumbCollection  // only mechanical

Component PowerSupply
Port GridInput Input ElectricalPower
Port ControllerOut Output ElectricalPower
Port SlotHeaterOut Output ElectricalPower  // Separate!
Port GridHeaterOut Output ElectricalPower  // Separate!
Port TimerOut Output ElectricalPower
Port WiFiOut Output ElectricalPower

// ========== TOASTER ==========

Component Toaster
// External Ports - User Interaction
Port TouchInterface Input TouchInput
Port DisplayOutput Output DisplayData
Port PowerInput Input ElectricalPower
Port NotificationOutput Output WiFiData

// External Ports - Material Interaction
Port SlotHeat Output Heat
Port GridHeat Output Heat
Port CrumbInterface  // Mechanical

// Internal Parts
Part TouchDisplay as display
Part Microcontroller as controller
Part HeatingElement as slotHeater
Part HeatingElement as gridHeater
Part Timer as timer
Part WiFiModule as wifi
Part ToastChamber as chamber
Part BreadRollAttachment as rollAttachment
Part CrumbTray as crumbTray
Part PowerSupply as power

// Delegations - User Interface
Delegation TouchInterface - display:TouchSurface
Delegation DisplayOutput - display:Visual
Delegation PowerInput - power:GridInput
Delegation NotificationOutput - wifi:Antenna

// Delegations - Material Interface
Delegation SlotHeat - chamber:SlotOutput
Delegation GridHeat - rollAttachment:GridOutput
Delegation CrumbInterface - crumbTray:CrumbCollection

// Internal Connections - Control
Connection display:Controller - controller:DisplayInterface
Connection controller:SlotHeaterControl - slotHeater:ControlSignal
Connection controller:GridHeaterControl - gridHeater:ControlSignal
Connection controller:WiFiControl - wifi:Controller
Connection timer:TimeSignal - controller:TimerInterface

// Internal Connections - Power
Connection power:ControllerOut - controller:PowerIn
Connection power:SlotHeaterOut - slotHeater:PowerIn
Connection power:GridHeaterOut - gridHeater:PowerIn
Connection power:TimerOut - timer:PowerIn
Connection power:WiFiOut - wifi:PowerIn

// Internal Connections - Heat Flow
Connection slotHeater:HeatOutput - chamber:HeatInterface
Connection gridHeater:HeatOutput - rollAttachment:HeatInterface

// ========== SUPERSYSTEM ==========

Component Supersystem
// Human & Digital
Part User as user
Part Smartphone as smartphone

// Infrastructure
Part PowerGrid as grid

// System Under Development
Part Toaster as toaster

// Material
Part Toast as bread
Part Breadroll as roll
Part Crumbs as crumbs

// User Interactions
Connection user:Hand - toaster:TouchInterface
Connection toaster:DisplayOutput - user:Eye

// Infrastructure
Connection grid:Outlet - toaster:PowerInput
Connection toaster:NotificationOutput - smartphone:WiFi

// Material Interactions
Connection toaster:SlotHeat - bread:Surface
Connection toaster:GridHeat - roll:Surface
Connection crumbs:Collection - toaster:CrumbInterface